	(text "SLOT CONNECTOR is XT-30(+2) PINOUT:\n  - 1 VIN_BUS (power contact furthest from signal pins)\n  - 2 GND (power contact between pin 1 and the signals)\n  - 3 CANH / CAN_BUS_P\n  - 4 CANL / CAN_BUS_N"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.352 143.256 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.143 1.143)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "415c46db-a155-42d0-ba46-9d08531f777a")
	)
	(text "NOTES:\n\n  - J7 is small screw terminal block. DNP for factory, user solders on.\n    1 GND\n    2 CANL / CAN_EXT_N\n    3 CANH / CAN_EXT_P\n\n  - Only the external CAN boundary receives L3 common-mode filtering and D1 ESD protection.\n      Each mate already protects its slot interface with ESD.\n\n  - TCAN3413 STB is hard-tied low for permanent normal operation.\n\nLAYOUT:\n\n  - Keep SJ1 and R17 together on CAN_BUS_P/N, on the trunk side of L3.\n      Place them at the physical far end of the routed CAN trunk (currently beside J6), not beside L3/J7.\n      Connect the series jumper and 120 Ω resistor directly across CANH/CANL with the shortest practical branch and minimum loop area."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 50.292 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.143 1.143)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "46b7135b-a64c-42a0-b0ad-bf317b90a787")
	)
	(text ""
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 32.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "899dd5be-0164-4996-b084-412cf8a442ec")
	)
	(text "CAN-FD TRUNK, EXTERNAL BOUNDARY AND SIX SLOTS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 17.5 0)
		(effects
